{"rpid": "110159", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "redrum", "mid": "5497", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "Filmed over the period of a few months in and around Edinburgh by Dave Sowerby, this video of Inspired Bicycles team rider Danny MacAskill (more info at dannymacaskill.com) features probably the best collection of street/street trials riding ever seen. There's some huge riding, but also some of the most technically difficult and imaginative lines you will ever see. Without a doubt, this video pushes the envelope of what is perceived as possible on a trials bike.<br />\nCredit to Band of Horses for their epic song 'The Funeral.' You can find out more about the band and their music at bandofhorses.com", "like": 3, "ctime": 1276585229, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "9786", "video_bvid": "BV1bx411c7NW", "video_title": "Inspired Bicycles - Danny MacAskill April 2009", "video_desc": "誒 為啥沒人看喵=3=youtube的點擊都有一千八百多萬了呢orz", "video_owner": "redrum", "video_view": 1452, "video_reply": 11, "video_n1": 10, "video_n2": 1}
